### --- Variaveis ---
### Assumir que voce tem um token admin valido
### e pelo menos um especialista criado

@base_url = http://localhost:8080
@token = SEU_TOKEN_ADMIN_AQUI
@specialist_id = SEU_SPECIALIST_ID_AQUI
@rule_id = SEU_RULE_ID_AQUI

### =============================================
### JSON API — Regras de Cross-Sell (Admin)
### =============================================

### Listar regras de cross-sell do especialista
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Criar regra — trigger por keyword
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger": {
    "type": "keyword",
    "value": "inventario"
  },
  "target_product_id": "SEU_PRODUCT_ID_AQUI",
  "priority": 1
}

### Criar regra — trigger por step_answer
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger": {
    "type": "step_answer",
    "step_id": "SEU_STEP_ID_AQUI",
    "value": "sim"
  },
  "target_product_id": "SEU_PRODUCT_ID_AQUI",
  "priority": 2
}

### Atualizar regra
PUT {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules/{{rule_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger": {
    "type": "keyword",
    "value": "heranca"
  },
  "target_product_id": "SEU_PRODUCT_ID_AQUI",
  "priority": 1
}

### Remover regra
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules/{{rule_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Reordenar — mover regra para cima
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules/{{rule_id}}/move-up
Cookie: token={{token}}

### Reordenar — mover regra para baixo
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules/{{rule_id}}/move-down
Cookie: token={{token}}

### =============================================
### HTMX — Configuracao de Cross-Sell (fragmentos)
### =============================================

### Renderizar secao cross-sell do especialista (fragmento)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true

### Atualizar config de cross-sell (form POST)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell/config
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

cross_sell_enabled=true&cross_sell_mode=announce&cross_sell_announcement_template=Vou transferi-lo para o especialista mais indicado.&allow_ai_cross_sell_suggestion=false

### Criar regra via form HTMX
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules/htmx
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

trigger_type=keyword&trigger_value=inventario&target_product_id=SEU_PRODUCT_ID_AQUI

### Remover regra via HTMX
DELETE {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules/htmx/{{rule_id}}
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true

### Mover regra para cima via HTMX
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules/htmx/{{rule_id}}/move-up
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true

### Mover regra para baixo via HTMX
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules/htmx/{{rule_id}}/move-down
Cookie: token={{token}}
HX-Request: true

### =============================================
### Testes OWASP
### =============================================

### A01 — Sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules

### A01 — Token de usuario comum (deve retornar 403)
### Substituir pelo token de um usuario com role "user"
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/{{specialist_id}}/cross-sell-rules
Cookie: token=TOKEN_USUARIO_COMUM

### A04/A05 — Acessar regras de outro tenant (deve retornar 403 ou 404)
### Substituir specialist_id por ID de especialista de outro tenant
GET {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/SPECIALIST_DE_OUTRO_TENANT/cross-sell-rules
Cookie: token={{token}}

### A04/A05 — Criar regra para especialista de outro tenant (deve retornar 403 ou 404)
POST {{base_url}}/admin/specialists/SPECIALIST_DE_OUTRO_TENANT/cross-sell-rules
Cookie: token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "trigger": { "type": "keyword", "value": "teste" },
  "target_product_id": "qualquer-id",
  "priority": 1
}
